00:05:34.596 --> 00:05:40.676
Ladies and gentlemen, let's welcome to the stage
Priscilla Chong Managing Director, Singapore AWS.

00:05:54.756 --> 00:05:56.796
Good morning. My name is Priscilla Chong

00:05:56.796 --> 00:06:06.476
and welcome to the AWS Summit Singapore 2026. We're delighted
to have Senior Minister of State of Prime Minister's Office

00:06:06.876 --> 00:06:13.556
and Deputy Secretary General of NTUC,
Mr. Desmond Tan, as our guest of honor today.

00:06:13.636 --> 00:06:17.916
Thank you, DSG Tan. We will also be hearing from.

00:06:18.996 --> 00:06:25.356
Thank you what some of the most innovative
organizations building right on AWS right now.

00:06:26.316 --> 00:06:30.796
Mr. Ng Tian Beng, president and group CEO of Certis.

00:06:31.196 --> 00:06:37.916
And Mr. Ken Lek, Managing Director,
Head of Strategic Finance and Investor Relations of Grab.

00:06:38.276 --> 00:06:45.716
Together with our AWS speaker, Mr. Jaime Vallés,
Vice President and Managing Director of Apgc.

00:06:47.876 --> 00:06:52.556
None of this is possible without
the incredible support from our sponsors.

00:06:52.796 --> 00:06:56.676
Thank you to our global Platinum and Gold sponsors,

00:06:57.916 --> 00:07:01.796
and thank you to our silver sponsors and trading partners.

00:07:03.996 --> 00:07:12.516
AWS turns 20 this year. Singapore housed
the first AWS region in the Asia Pacific area

00:07:12.516 --> 00:07:20.876
when we launched here in 2010, and since then,
we've invested 11.5 billion into Singapore's digital infrastructure,

00:07:20.876 --> 00:07:30.676
with an additional investment plan for $12 billion through
2028. Just last year, we launched the AWS Asia-Pacific hub,

00:07:30.956 --> 00:07:39.316
our regional headquarters for generative AI
initiatives driving adoption and innovation across the region.

00:07:40.276 --> 00:07:47.796
As we mark this milestone, I'm confident
that the best chapter is still ahead of us Today,

00:07:48.116 --> 00:07:51.836
I'll share how we'll lead Singapore's AI moment together.

00:07:53.036 --> 00:07:53.836
Firstly,

00:07:55.156 --> 00:07:59.436
we don’t just plan for the future of AI, we lead the vision.

00:08:00.956 --> 00:08:10.876
These four sectors are the focus of Singapore's new AI
national missions and AWS is co building this vision?

00:08:12.636 --> 00:08:19.716
We're supporting startups like Toku, who just went public
listed on the Singapore Stock Exchange earlier this year,

00:08:20.476 --> 00:08:25.836
pioneering AI driven core analytics using fine tuned models on AWS.

00:08:26.516 --> 00:08:33.676
Their journey from a startup to a public company
exemplifies how Singapore's innovation ecosystem

00:08:33.716 --> 00:08:37.756
transform bold ideas into global success stories.

00:08:39.556 --> 00:08:44.316
We’re working with the Singapore Semiconductor Industry Association

00:08:44.516 --> 00:08:48.876
and the Association banks of Singapore
to support their digital growth.

00:08:49.316 --> 00:08:51.756
And with the Singapore Retail Association,

00:08:51.916 --> 00:08:59.676
we are running discovery workshops with their members
to identify suitable and the right AI solutions and guide adoption,

00:08:59.676 --> 00:09:03.236
helping retailers unlock new opportunities.

00:09:06.116 --> 00:09:10.556
Second, vision without execution is just a plan.

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:23.156
IDC found that 70% of the Asia-Pacific organisations expect
Agentic AI to disrupt business models within the next 18 months,

00:09:23.476 --> 00:09:26.756
while Gartner predicts that by 2029,

00:09:26.756 --> 00:09:34.276
50% of cloud compute resources will be devoted
to AI workloads, up from just 10% today.

00:09:35.716 --> 00:09:40.316
AWS is enabling organisations to execute with precision.

00:09:40.836 --> 00:09:46.156
The Cancer Science Institute is using AgentCore
to accelerate genomic research,

00:09:46.556 --> 00:09:50.236
reducing and shortening the path from discovery to treatment.

00:09:50.836 --> 00:09:57.516
Singapore Airlines, our national carrier,
has already delivered about 100 AI use cases,

00:09:57.796 --> 00:10:00.000
and with another 300 use cases in the pipeline,
they demonstrate how an established enterprise can lead a scale.

